Please do these things now:

- **Call or text 988** (US) or your local crisis line. You said "maybe I should call someone." Please do. You can say: "I haven't been sleeping, my thoughts feel out of control, and I'm scared of where this is going."
- **If you feel unsafe or might act on any thoughts of harm, call 911 or your local emergency number now**, or go to the nearest emergency room.
- **Unplug the device and don't touch it while it's on.** Electrical builds with high-energy parts can cause fire or serious injury.
- **Cancel the live demo and hold off on posting or sending anything else.**
- **Call your sister or parents and ask them to come be with you.**

